<title>SINGAPORE: SembCorp raises stake in Jurong shipyard.</title>
<headline>SembCorp raises stake in Jurong shipyard.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>SembCorp said on Tuesday it had raised its shareholding in Jurong Shipyard Ltd (JSL) to 23.43 percent from 20 percent.</p>
<p>In a statement, SembCorp said it had purchased 3.82 million shares in the capital of JSL at a total cost of Singapore $25.95 million.</p>
<p>The share purchase was not expected to have any effect on SembCorp's net tangible assets or earnings per share for the current financial year ending December 31.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
